Package: meteo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: lighttpd, gpsd
Description: Websocket server for Vaisala weather station
 Reads a Vaisala MAWS weather station over a serial port and a GPS receiver
 through gpsd, and pushes the data to a browser client via websocket.
 Also ships the web client and a lighttpd configuration to serve it.
